{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is... the demo! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world famous meme debuts in his first video game. Play as Question Hound in a retro adventure platformer, traversing perilous pits and enraged enemies to overcome the manifestations of his anxieties! Play through the first world <strong>Humiliation</strong>\u00a0battling against high school memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994730/extras/20d24801277d5886eafde41fa41a2a33.poster.avif?t=1760542816\" width=610 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994730/extras/20d24801277d5886eafde41fa41a2a33.webm?t=1760542816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This Is Fine. Everything Is Fine. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Except it isn\u2019t. Welcome to the inside of Question Hound\u2019s brain: a collapsing theme park of our deepest inner anxieties manifested. The only way out is through, and it is going to take some grit! Descend into the depths of Question Hound\u2019s mind and solve your way out.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994730/extras/4597b0f0ac8f3a279d4873c57e7e5ef3.poster.avif?t=1760542816\" width=612 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994730/extras/4597b0f0ac8f3a279d4873c57e7e5ef3.webm?t=1760542816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994730/extras/4597b0f0ac8f3a279d4873c57e7e5ef3.mp4?t=1760542816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Humiliation. Fear. Failure. Loss. Regret.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve all felt them, but have you been trapped inside their prison teeming with minions? Taunted by the ghostly memories of your high school blunder years, hunted by dizzying work deadlines, or haunted by all those things you should never have done. Sounds fun, right?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s time to face those demons head-on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994730/extras/301319f1bc2c6b403ca769161f704e68.poster.avif?t=1760542816\" width=612 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994730/extras/301319f1bc2c6b403ca769161f704e68.webm?t=1760542816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's Lies Ahead?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the landscapes, beat bosses, unlock abilities, and access new chapters. This is a metroidvania. As you platform your way through each world you\u2019ll encounter enemies, each an embodiment of everyday worries. Through navigation and persistence, you will ultimately face the challenging bosses unique to every area. Defeat them and acquire the abilities needed to progress further (and explore previous areas in more depth)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994730/extras/eae35565fdd8a91dcd5dc4cb43e0c2a7.poster.avif?t=1760542816\" width=612 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994730/extras/eae35565fdd8a91dcd5dc4cb43e0c2a7.webm?t=1760542816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to stop at every burning Rest Point to save, sip coffee, and pretend everything is fine for a brief moment. Collect Coffee Beans as you explore; your currency used to purchase perks and refill your healing coffee cup. Keep your eyes peeled everywhere you go if your heart is set on finding every quirky collectible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994730/extras/35d8ad569f9232ef90158f5698175c7a.poster.avif?t=1760542816\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994730/extras/35d8ad569f9232ef90158f5698175c7a.webm?t=1760542816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A World Brought to Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Is Fine: Maximum Cope transforms KC Green\u2019s famous comic, into a beautifully brought-to-life labyrinth of absurd anxiety. Angst and helplessness have never looked so good!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated with love and care, every world is a dreamy surreal experience, every enemy oozes with personality, and every boss looms larger than life. It\u2019s weird, fun, and just the right amount of unhinged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994730/extras/ac515847bbc18df5e77486ff9bd7477d.poster.avif?t=1760542816\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994730/extras/ac515847bbc18df5e77486ff9bd7477d.webm?t=1760542816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is fine. Everything is fine. It\u2019s also a metroidvania where you\u2019re beating up your inner demons for coffee beans. Fight through Humiliation, Fear, Failure, Loss, and Regret with a smile on your face and the fire at your heels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994730/extras/f1a6806e936a1b149b86c8b77443eb94.poster.avif?t=1760542816\" width=612 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994730/extras/f1a6806e936a1b149b86c8b77443eb94.webm?t=1760542816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 5 surreal worlds of Humiliation, Fear, Failure, Loss, and Regret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 6 bosses and abilities to master</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 28 collectibles to find</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 27 Perks to unlock</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994730?t=1760542816","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994730/773e0f6459b675bf20e7eb8c7e0ba51656a7cc2c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760542816","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994730/d97a4ca3631c060d6a9c3edc2540ad713d5e56b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760542816","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994730/d97a4ca3631c060d6a9c3edc2540ad713d5e56b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760542816","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is... the demo! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragr